The authors have address my concerns about certain theoretical and experimental questions:

1. They show by introducing existing literature that mutual information can be used to provide the privacy guarantee for the proposed method;

2. They summarize the details of the propose recovery method of pairwise-distance;

3. They discuss the limitation of the proposed method for the scenarios where only 2 clients are available.

Based on these response, I decide to upgrade my confidence by 1 while keeping the existing rating 4.

